  "answer": "HippoRAG 从文档构建知识图谱的方式是“builds a KG from scratch using LLMs and performs multi-hop retrieval without any supervision”[chunk_513a6dee6b9d2e8bac593f0a139f9ba4]；其机制侧重检索本身，原文称其改进“solely based on improved retrieval”[chunk_513a6dee6b9d2e8bac593f0a139f9ba4]。KGP 的构图模块“create a knowledge graph (KG) over multiple documents with nodes symbolizing passages or document structures (e.g., pages/tables), and edges denoting the semantic/lexical similarity between passages or document structural relations”[chunk_b959214e888053dae53b16a5259d7ea9]。找回跨段落支持时，KGP 设计“an LLM-based graph traversal agent that navigates across nodes and gathers supporting passages”[chunk_b959214e888053dae53b16a5259d7ea9]；另有原文描述该 agent“predicts missing evidence based on the initial query and the retrieved documents”[chunk_50ac7448bcb598aae5034af337bca656]，再据此从邻居节点检索相关段落。上下文明确提到 HippoRAG 做多跳检索，但上述摘录未给出其具体遍历/扩展机制，HippoRAG 的机制细节不足。",
